 "result": "I documented 12 repos this run: qsr-receipt-sim, androids, cross-venue-equivalence-engine, datacenter-osint, kat-chat, rogue-rail, kvs-roulette, checkin-kiosk, ordersim, mind-globe, rie-api, and RTSS. Each got a README, a CHANGELOG, and one \"docs: scribe update\" commit. RTSS already had a short README, so I kept it and added the scribe sections below it.\n\nMind-globe has a Railway backend at the root and its web app in a subfolder. Its commit statuses show only Railway deploys and no Vercel, so I judged a docs push safe and did not add a root vercel.json. I could not confirm that against Vercel, but the live site was still up before the push and I did not recheck it afterward. Checkin-kiosk already has a root vercel.json.\n\nThe publish jobs, state, and repo map are saved in control-troll. I also pushed the refreshed profile page to sudosilo/sudosilo, and committed the notes and state to control-troll main. I added itchy-troll, text-based-game, shared-server, and forkmill-zx to the repo map with no apps. About 61 backfills remain, so roughly five more runs. I reached every repo I tried.",
